    <briefdescription>
<para>Cross-feature regression matrix bootstrap for <ref refid="structthemis_1_1query_1_1_query" kindref="compound">Query</ref> Block D. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Validates parser/planner-level interoperability across:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>AQL + FTS SEARCH clause</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>AQL + geospatial predicates</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Multi-FOR / join-style query shapes</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Plan-cache deadline handling on cross-feature query text</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>The suite is intentionally parser/planner focused so it can run as an early regression gate while executor/backend wiring expands toward the broader 1,000+ test target tracked in <computeroutput>src/query/ROADMAP.md</computeroutput>. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
